<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Mod id="abcd9d5c-be6b-41fa-9a60-a62169edfd26" version="2">
  <Properties>
    <Name>Wat Arun Wonder</Name>
    <Teaser>Wat Arun, the first of three wonders this week!</Teaser>
    <Description>Wat Arun is a large Buddhist temple located in Bangkok, the capital city of Thailand. It was constructed on the bank of the Chao Phraya River possibly during the 18th century. Although it is a Buddhist temple, it was named after  Aruna, the personification of Dawn in the Hindu faith. The temple is reminicent of Khmer architectural styles, featuring a large central Prang, common in Khmer designs. Ingame, Wat Arun provides +1 [ICON_PEACE] Faith for every River tile worked by the city, and requires a river in the city and Economics.</Description>
    <Authors>Pouakai, sukritact</Authors>
    <SpecialThanks>Mentos, moriboe, Ambrox62</SpecialThanks>
